  "translatedAt": "2026-08-31T04:53:24.301Z",
  "title": "Resolve Conflict with GALV_LayerGraphicsMZ & Add Features [RPG Maker MZ Plugin]",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "title",
      "type": "title",
      "source": "GALV_LayerGraphicsMZとの競合を解消＆機能追加【RPGツクールMZプラグイン】",
      "sourceHash": "b6a2f6fe64d193360841a236c3e15297badad65842d2ad2daf2bcb67d7f8c19e",
      "translation": "Resolve Conflict with GALV_LayerGraphicsMZ & Add Features [RPG Maker MZ Plugin]",
      "contextHash": "b6a2f6fe64d193360841a236c3e15297badad65842d2ad2daf2bcb67d7f8c19e"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-001",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "当ブログのNRP系プラグインとGALV_LayerGraphicsMZとの競合を解消します。",
      "sourceHash": "5f1b31c256604777692e6cb69862b1457a64cdcd4a36934e5d5048e1e773f75c",
      "translation": "This resolves conflicts between this blog's NRP-series plugins and GALV_LayerGraphicsMZ.",
      "contextHash": "5f1b31c256604777692e6cb69862b1457a64cdcd4a36934e5d5048e1e773f75c"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-002",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "遠景・近景を自由に設定できるので、マップ上に浮かぶ雲やスクロールする背景などの演出が可能となります。個人的にも大変重宝しています。",
      "sourceHash": "a08960dae86c8888b9533e7b639b1abbb6dbc3ff53965a7b769a8413ea8a21e9",
      "translation": "Since you can freely configure distant and near backgrounds, you can create effects such as clouds floating over the map or scrolling backgrounds. I personally find it extremely useful.",
      "contextHash": "a08960dae86c8888b9533e7b639b1abbb6dbc3ff53965a7b769a8413ea8a21e9"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-003",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "そこで競合を解消するためのプラグインを作成しました。",
      "sourceHash": "d18d7a75c0820640fec783bc110523fcbe42a06f28c0b29501fa52bccc836a53",
      "translation": "Therefore, I created a plugin to resolve the conflict.",
      "contextHash": "d18d7a75c0820640fec783bc110523fcbe42a06f28c0b29501fa52bccc836a53"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-004",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ついでにループマップへの対応など、ちょっとした機能追加もしています。",
      "sourceHash": "5126c1415ad5c81b8b87497e0de0830cc42021f135bbf6c7223de5bdb8e3a80c",
      "translation": "I also added a few minor features, such as support for loop maps.",
      "contextHash": "5126c1415ad5c81b8b87497e0de0830cc42021f135bbf6c7223de5bdb8e3a80c"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-005",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "※GALV_LayerGraphicsMZ ver1.2で動作確認しています。",
      "sourceHash": "6be06886953b9ba763a39937254ba13404cf90f89ba4a21916a3f22483394d5f",
      "translation": "※Operation has been confirmed with GALV_LayerGraphicsMZ ver1.2.",
      "contextHash": "6be06886953b9ba763a39937254ba13404cf90f89ba4a21916a3f22483394d5f"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-006",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "※Galv様の利用規約ではプラグイン＆スクリプトを改変して配布するのは禁止となっています。そのため、元のソースは流用しない方式でプラグインを作成しています。",
      "sourceHash": "870b5884920cdf7aca9e771a00f1bf9899ba471cdf3dc27b55ba800bc65e2e86",
      "translation": "※Galv's terms of use prohibit modifying and redistributing plugins and scripts. Therefore, I created this plugin without reusing the original source.",
      "contextHash": "870b5884920cdf7aca9e771a00f1bf9899ba471cdf3dc27b55ba800bc65e2e86"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-001",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "目次",
      "sourceHash": "6763aa62211b44a20c71505eed18421683192c2f2f37668012e8aaa008367120",
      "translation": "Table of Contents",
      "contextHash": "6763aa62211b44a20c71505eed18421683192c2f2f37668012e8aaa008367120"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-002",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "導入方法（install）",
      "sourceHash": "a74eebb051e898173751a501ebea136f6891e7f24c5dc00722bd5bd693d13275",
      "translation": "Installation (install)",
      "contextHash": "a74eebb051e898173751a501ebea136f6891e7f24c5dc00722bd5bd693d13275"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-007",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "以下のファイルをダウンロードし 、[プロジェクト]\\js\\plugins に放り込みます。ツクールのプラグイン管理から機能をONにしてください。",
      "sourceHash": "add69b36d300edf1592f52945943668587da00473f5edb9e6c87aeb402e1aa25",
      "translation": "Download the following file and place it in [Project]\\js\\plugins. Turn the feature ON from the RPG Maker plugin manager.",
      "contextHash": "add69b36d300edf1592f52945943668587da00473f5edb9e6c87aeb402e1aa25"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-008",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "※このプラグインはＭＺ専用です。",
      "sourceHash": "ed0c5667915fe7ad6e95a93a20e8331a11f4cc8b43f40dd22f930598cecbf19d",
      "translation": "※This plugin is for MZ only.",
      "contextHash": "ed0c5667915fe7ad6e95a93a20e8331a11f4cc8b43f40dd22f930598cecbf19d"
    },
