      "id": "heading-009",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "使用方法（Usage）",
      "sourceHash": "25d0346b6851547b0b6d3d18bb163958617996499b78e2fa5feef574272b89b9",
      "translation": "Usage (Usage)",
      "contextHash": "25d0346b6851547b0b6d3d18bb163958617996499b78e2fa5feef574272b89b9"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-010",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "適用するだけでＯＫです。",
      "sourceHash": "bba3ea506f92d2040ff9252a9835ffb9134ffa62ec8fa227591170183b84c114",
      "translation": "Simply apply it.",
      "contextHash": "bba3ea506f92d2040ff9252a9835ffb9134ffa62ec8fa227591170183b84c114"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-011",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "詳細は以下のプラグインパラメータの説明をご覧ください。",
      "sourceHash": "e705397662361618b33d79e8649420a9c382aa262b97790c46eb6747e4b3122b",
      "translation": "For details, see the explanations of the following plugin parameters.",
      "contextHash": "e705397662361618b33d79e8649420a9c382aa262b97790c46eb6747e4b3122b"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-010",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "プラグインパラメータ（Plugin Parameter）",
      "sourceHash": "f4b540e9f0397a1265e0ce8b0574e8fade43b17d30f049312ef0f2eb5efd4805",
      "translation": "Plugin Parameters (Plugin Parameter)",
      "contextHash": "f4b540e9f0397a1265e0ce8b0574e8fade43b17d30f049312ef0f2eb5efd4805"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-011",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "ループマップに対応（SupportLoopMap）",
      "sourceHash": "1134a57773ab862bb46915ebc42d9432c3475ae52fd35ce98cffe10b92b81c5c",
      "translation": "Support for Loop Maps (SupportLoopMap)",
      "contextHash": "1134a57773ab862bb46915ebc42d9432c3475ae52fd35ce98cffe10b92b81c5c"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-012",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "LayerGraphicsをループマップに対応させます。ループをまたぐ際に表示がズレないようになります。",
      "sourceHash": "3edb6abedac206987098bbe1db69f3c66709c6beb4fa4b389cd05d491963c593",
      "translation": "Makes LayerGraphics support loop maps. Displaying layers will no longer shift when crossing a loop boundary.",
      "contextHash": "3edb6abedac206987098bbe1db69f3c66709c6beb4fa4b389cd05d491963c593"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-012",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "静的レイヤーの既定マップ（SupportStaticLayerDefaultMap）",
      "sourceHash": "8c35fda3ae0b64edfb7746d6dfc7580e38499dd41a3d0390a2391458165acfbb",
      "translation": "Default Map for Static Layers (SupportStaticLayerDefaultMap)",
      "contextHash": "8c35fda3ae0b64edfb7746d6dfc7580e38499dd41a3d0390a2391458165acfbb"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-013",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "静的レイヤー作成時、マップＩＤの指定がない場合は現在のマップを参照するようにします。",
      "sourceHash": "b00670c54445a77fc03b8bb2de551a4c8231b890c98d2851cf36e0040de12bcb",
      "translation": "When creating a static layer, the current map will be referenced if no map ID is specified.",
      "contextHash": "b00670c54445a77fc03b8bb2de551a4c8231b890c98d2851cf36e0040de12bcb"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-014",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "※通常のレイヤーに関しては、最初からこの機能がある模様です。",
      "sourceHash": "5f271aabb7bc4f18b0a8f8b80ba53f7b06c9fcaa6b4166a1f1ea3db3721ac564",
      "translation": "※It appears that this feature is already available for regular layers.",
      "contextHash": "5f271aabb7bc4f18b0a8f8b80ba53f7b06c9fcaa6b4166a1f1ea3db3721ac564"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-013",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "DynamicMotionとの競合解消（ForDynamicMotion）",
      "sourceHash": "643b55deab2b5b75240d8ad53e6affc64a8250087a251883c03b28e528fd8dfa",
      "translation": "Resolve Conflict with DynamicMotion (ForDynamicMotion)",
      "contextHash": "643b55deab2b5b75240d8ad53e6affc64a8250087a251883c03b28e528fd8dfa"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-015",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "NRP_DynamicMotionMZ、およびNRP_TroopRandomFormationとの競合を解消します。適用すると敵のＺ座標が、GALV_LayerGraphicsMZの設定値（変更不可）から変更されます。",
      "sourceHash": "dd8358567c9b5d8f942e45ba30dd945c0486c0aea93befba00c255b59f7144c6",
      "translation": "Resolves conflicts with NRP_DynamicMotionMZ and NRP_TroopRandomFormation. When enabled, the enemy's Z coordinate is changed from the GALV_LayerGraphicsMZ setting (which cannot be changed).",
      "contextHash": "dd8358567c9b5d8f942e45ba30dd945c0486c0aea93befba00c255b59f7144c6"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-016",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "GALV_LayerGraphicsMZの設定値=2 → NRP_DynamicMotionMZの既定値=3",
      "sourceHash": "f48c2d7d65a346b2e92846a591a66f0a166110eb1f2124d4b88f501fa23436e0",
      "translation": "GALV_LayerGraphicsMZ setting = 2 → NRP_DynamicMotionMZ default value = 3",
      "contextHash": "f48c2d7d65a346b2e92846a591a66f0a166110eb1f2124d4b88f501fa23436e0"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-017",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "となります。",
      "sourceHash": "ed551a0f0732edc3bec983a373f519c7feb3d783741f8f50bfb82d15cb970f96",
      "translation": "This is the result.",
      "contextHash": "ed551a0f0732edc3bec983a373f519c7feb3d783741f8f50bfb82d15cb970f96"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-018",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "この値はNRP_DynamicMotionMZの『バトラーのＺ座標』のプラグインパラメータを参照していますので、変更も可能です。",
      "sourceHash": "e237b35d058e2f4975447377df586a9c9696765c5338cc1fc33826bdae6492a1",
      "translation": "This value references the 『Battler Z Coordinate』plugin parameter of NRP_DynamicMotionMZ, so it can also be changed.",
      "contextHash": "e237b35d058e2f4975447377df586a9c9696765c5338cc1fc33826bdae6492a1"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-019",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "なお、Ｚ座標とはGALV_LayerGraphicsMZの『zLevel』に相当します。各画像の表示優先度を調整するための値です。",
      "sourceHash": "b39d575eacb303251073bc5a0bd22cd2dd1a646463db405466f534dfaff0e79a",
      "translation": "The Z coordinate corresponds to 『zLevel』 in GALV_LayerGraphicsMZ. It is a value used to adjust the display priority of each image.",
      "contextHash": "b39d575eacb303251073bc5a0bd22cd2dd1a646463db405466f534dfaff0e79a"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-014",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "ズームアウトに対応（SupportZoomOut）",
      "sourceHash": "aea4528a41f70a2857b49f7a45337c39ea38bcc156e5438e3a9e206e2a33db58",
      "translation": "Support for Zooming Out (SupportZoomOut)",
      "contextHash": "aea4528a41f70a2857b49f7a45337c39ea38bcc156e5438e3a9e206e2a33db58"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-020",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ズームアウト処理に対応します。",
      "sourceHash": "aed53d14c63fd9a64126ed5558fc6345ce5db865b94e0cce1d7b8f9b37405d88",
      "translation": "Supports zoom-out processing.",
      "contextHash": "aed53d14c63fd9a64126ed5558fc6345ce5db865b94e0cce1d7b8f9b37405d88"
    }
  ],
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "line-001",
      "type": "line",
      "source": "※遠景周りの機能については、新たに[[LINK_1]]自在に遠景（近景）を表示するプラグイン[[/LINK_1]]を公開しています。今後は主にあちらを更新していく予定です。",
      "sourceHash": "fa452563fea94a4f6bdf001116a107d6cc8e39ca5e6f6b2d32a0dc9420a0f54f",
      "parts": [
        {
          "source": "※遠景周りの機能については、新たに",
          "link": false
        },
        {
          "source": "自在に遠景（近景）を表示するプラグイン",
          "link": true,
          "linkIndex": 1
        },
        {
          "source": "を公開しています。今後は主にあちらを更新していく予定です。",
          "link": false
        }
      ],
      "translation": "※Regarding features related to parallax backgrounds, I have newly released a [[LINK_1]]plugin for freely displaying parallax backgrounds (foregrounds)[[/LINK_1]]. I plan to mainly update that one from now on.",
      "contextHash": "fa452563fea94a4f6bdf001116a107d6cc8e39ca5e6f6b2d32a0dc9420a0f54f"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-002",
      "type": "line",
      "source": "[[LINK_1]]GALV_LayerGraphicsMZ[[/LINK_1]]（Galv様）は画像レイヤーを追加するプラグインです。",
      "sourceHash": "cc6fc8ff1f51f6fec254f0af4aa2daf992e48f1382a9efc2143ef2c10cb720f6",
      "parts": [
        {
          "source": "GALV_LayerGraphicsMZ",
          "link": true,
          "linkIndex": 1
        },
        {
          "source": "（Galv様）は画像レイヤーを追加するプラグインです。",
          "link": false
        }
      ],
      "translation": "[[LINK_1]]GALV_LayerGraphicsMZ[[/LINK_1]] (Galv) is a plugin that adds image layers.",
      "contextHash": "cc6fc8ff1f51f6fec254f0af4aa2daf992e48f1382a9efc2143ef2c10cb720f6"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-003",
      "type": "line",
      "source": "※[[LINK_1]]ムノクラ様による日本語化パッチ[[/LINK_1]]もあります。",
      "sourceHash": "b21f9ef2889e479dd310948df01840e9d0e8d2980c2e5236cc71c46fa5277f52",
      "parts": [
        {
          "source": "※",
          "link": false
        },
        {
          "source": "ムノクラ様による日本語化パッチ",
          "link": true,
          "linkIndex": 1
        },
        {
          "source": "もあります。",
          "link": false
        }
      ],
      "translation": "※A [[LINK_1]]Japanese translation patch by Munokura[[/LINK_1]] is also available.",
